{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27319","headline":"鸟散余花落 · 窦洵直","name":"鸟散余花落","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚树春归後，花飞鸟下初。\n参差分羽翼，零落满空虚。\n风外清香转，林边艳影疎。\n轻盈疑雪舞，髣髴似霞舒。\n万片情难极，迁乔思有余。\n微臣一何幸，吟赏对寒居。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦洵直","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}